Z||000007||Boodoggin||08-03-2000||11:00 PM||||Mine is kind of a funny story.  I grew up in Chicago and when I was 13 I was told I had to move to Idaho, when I got to Idaho I was in total shock.  Idaho was unlike anything I had ever seen.  It's like 2 totaly different countries.  Anyways on the way into Boise we passed a redneck in a 70's ford pick-up truck with bullet holes in the sides, confederate flag, gun rack, beer cans in the bed, the whole nine.  I was totaly shocked.  then I looked at his liscense plates they said "Boodogn".  I laughed really hard.  Always thought it was kind of funny.||||reg||6
