Z||000011||StuGood||08-04-2000||12:50 AM||||Well, Stu is my real name - that part's real original  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">!<P>When you pronounce "StuGood," it sounds like you're saying, "It's too good!"  - which is what I say to myself everytime I drive one of the Fieros  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.  <P>When the Fiero came out, I could hardly believe it!  GM actually <B>built</B> the little mid-engine sports car I used to doodle on the edges of my papers in high school. The plastic, rustproof kit car I always wanted was available - and already built, instead of a five-year project.<P>It <B>is</B> too good  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> !      ||||reg||6
