Z||000013||Raydar||08-04-2000||01:26 AM||||From the song "Radar Love", by Golden Earring. <BR>Started out as an AOL screen name. <BR><I>Radar</I> Love was already taken. Hence the "Y" in Raydar.<BR>Also used to work on microwave radio equipment. ("Do It 'Till Your Giga-Hertz.")<P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR>88 Formula T-Top <BR>88 Coupe (ISO big V-6)<P>"Some mornings, it just isn't worth<BR>chewing through the restraints."<p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 08-04-2000).]||||reg||1
