Z||000024||MotherGoose||08-04-2000||10:12 AM||||I look like Dr. Greene(Anthony Edwards) from ER, who also played Goose in Top Gun.  When ER got popular everyone called me Dr. Greene, except one guy always called me Goose.  He rationalized that since I was once in the Air Force was the better nickname.  I agree and it has been so ever since.<P>(note: I know that Top Gun is the naval school for fighter pilots, but when Top Gun came out Air Force recruitment went up 30%, the Navys only went up 5%.  I guess people associate planes with the Air Force.)||||reg||1
