Z||000036||Formula||08-04-2000||04:38 PM||||mines an educated disphelication of intellectual acheivement combined with an egronamiticly correct substance known as krypton.  This in turn creates a dynamic recealiton of conservence in the broth field of aviotic coruption.  While the corelation of physical attributes to this in an ingenious way, the name formula comes from the greek word meaning Fiero, as the fiero became a supercar the greek republic of aztic decided to originate a new word for the way to splice genes into biologically reproduced pigs.  I know the abbreviation of the word Quantaceptical is QAL and if you turn that backwards it says LAQ then you interrupt the exchange of atoms between the L and the Q and it becomes a Formula for a science procedure known as Dialectic Rebirth. Of course this procedure is used only for pigs in the month of November while they are giving birth to 3 equal cows at the moo garage.  This is why my name is Formula..<P>ok... who was expecting that one???? LOL||||reg||1
