Z||000043||Patrick's Dad||08-04-2000||09:09 PM||||Well, it's kind of self explanitory, except that I'm not the dad of Patrick, here on the forum. My Patrick is four years old.<P>On Tuesday nights last summer, some friends started to get together with thier cars, mostly older hot rods (Evertything from a 1940 Ford to a 1972 Corvette Stingray). I brought my boy over in my Formula. As we walked around, looking at the cars, the guys thought he was the greatest, lookking at the cars with his dad. A couple asked him if he wanted to sit in their cars, and one asked which car he liked the best. My boy said, "The white one."<P>I'll give you one guess who had the only white car on the lot?<P>------------------<BR>This should work until my site comes online....   <IMG SRC="http://homestead.deja.com/user.rshuman/files/Tmh.jpg"> ||||reg||6
