Z||000048||Monkeyman||08-05-2000||02:16 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, lucidatypewriter">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DaRkLoRD:<BR><B>I'm a Star Wars fan.. DaRkLoRD is a reference to darth vader (his full title was dark lord of the sith) and I alternated the capital letters just to make it look funky.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I first used this name on IRC in 1996, and I've been using it ever since. I'm starting to get tired of it though.... I have a better nickname in mind for when I get my Fiero though!!!!!!!!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Actually his full title is:  Vader, Dark Lord of the Sith.  He has no name other than his given/birth name, Anikin Skywalker, which of course he doesn't use anymore.  Darth (as in Darth Vader) is a short name for his title. Like Darth Maul.  Kinda like Sir for someone who has been knighted in Great Britian.  Even the Emperor is a Darth.  I think he was called Darth something in Episode 5/The Empire Strikes Back.  BTW--I just read that Episode 2 should be out in very early 2002 with Episode 3 to follow in later 2003.  Can't wait!<P>||||reg||1
