Z||000054||DaRkLoRD||08-05-2000||06:39 PM||||Monkeyman, thanks for clearing that up..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>as for darth bane, I'd heard that's the name of the new sith apprentice, in ep2.. then again there are a lot of false rumors floating around about star wars these days.. lucas has very tight security, and occasionally intentionally leaks false info to throw people off.. but if you really want to get technical, the emperor's real name is Cos Palpatine.. Darth Sidious is his alter-ego..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>yeah, I need a life too. lol<P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A> <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||1
